WEBVTT

00:00.630 --> 00:03.000
Jacques knows his machine
better than anyone.

00:03.697 --> 00:05.917
In a year, he retires.

00:06.451 --> 00:11.271
And by 2030, twenty to thirty percent
of technologists will retire too.

00:11.849 --> 00:14.669
Their know-how isn't written down anywhere.

00:16.360 --> 00:18.040
Meet Clip.

00:18.648 --> 00:23.808
Film the expert while he explains.
Clip records it all, right on the phone.

00:24.307 --> 00:29.967
Add photos, a voice note, or
your old procedures in PDF and Word.

00:30.426 --> 00:34.436
Then, with a single button,
AI writes the work instruction.

00:34.885 --> 00:39.645
One action per step, the right video
clip, the warnings at the right time.

00:40.320 --> 00:45.303
Edit with a word. Annotate with a
click. Translate in seconds.

00:45.533 --> 00:49.663
And your old instructions?
Drop them in by the dozen,

00:49.613 --> 00:51.323
and they come out modernized.

00:51.840 --> 00:56.690
Get it approved, then deploy it to the
workstation, on a tablet or by QR code,

00:56.800 --> 00:57.490
no account needed.

00:58.028 --> 01:01.628
The operator follows each
step, hears it read aloud,

01:01.478 --> 01:03.148
and flags what isn't clear.

01:03.884 --> 01:06.324
And with one click, it exports to PDF.

01:07.200 --> 01:11.780
Clip. Your experts' know-how,
at the workstation, in minutes.

01:12.370 --> 01:13.460
Book a demo.
